[[File:Republic_Stealth_Ship_visible.png|thumb|250px|The Republic Stealth ship, an example of a patrol ship]]
A '''patrol ship''', also referred to as a '''patrol boat''' or '''patrol craft''', was a type of [[warship]] used chiefly to patrol an area. The experimental [[Galactic Republic]] [[IPV-2C Stealth Corvette]], the [[Auzituck anti-slaver gunship|''Auzituck'' anti-slaver gunship]], and the [[Firespray-31-class patrol and attack craft|''Firespray''-31-class patrol and attack craft]] were all classified as such.<ref name="VE">''[[Star Wars: The Visual Encyclopedia]]''</ref> The [[Chiss Ascendancy]] had a [[Chiss patrol ship|class]] of patrol ship.<ref name="Chaos Rising">''[[Thrawn Ascendancy: Chaos Rising]]''</ref> The [[Zyzek System Defense]] also employed patrol ships.<ref name="Lesser Evil">''[[Thrawn Ascendancy: Lesser Evil]]''</ref> A patrol craft were used by the [[Lioaoin Regime]]. Several patrol ships of their [[Lioaoin military|military]] were stationed above the [[Lioaoin heartworld]] along with Lioaoin freighters, Lioaoin corsairs, and space stations. Some patrol boats by the [[Vak Combine]] also served as [[starfighter]]s.<ref name="Chaos Rising" />

